INSERT INTO products (name, description, price) VALUES
('Wireless Bluetooth Headphones', 'Premium over-ear headphones with active noise cancellation, 30-hour battery life, and superior sound quality. Perfect for travel, work, or leisure.', 149.99),
('Smart Fitness Watch', 'Advanced fitness tracker with heart rate monitor, GPS, sleep tracking, and smartphone notifications. Water-resistant up to 50 meters.', 299.99),
('Stainless Steel Water Bottle', 'Double-walled insulated water bottle that keeps drinks cold for 24 hours or hot for 12 hours. BPA-free, leak-proof design with 32oz capacity.', 34.99),
('Mechanical Gaming Keyboard', 'RGB backlit mechanical keyboard with customizable keys, anti-ghosting technology, and dedicated media controls. Cherry MX switches for optimal gaming performance.', 129.99),
('Portable Power Bank', 'High-capacity 20000mAh power bank with fast charging support, dual USB ports, and LED display. Compatible with all smartphones and tablets.', 49.99);
INSERT INTO reviews (author, rating, content, productId) VALUES
('Sarah Mitchell', 5, 'These headphones are absolutely incredible! The noise cancellation works like magic on my daily commute. I can finally enjoy my music without the constant drone of traffic and train noise. The battery life is outstanding - I only need to charge them once a week despite using them several hours daily. The sound quality is crisp and balanced across all frequencies. The comfort level is exceptional even after wearing them for extended periods. Build quality feels premium and durable. The Bluetooth connection is stable and pairs instantly with my devices. Best headphones I have ever owned, worth every penny of the investment.', 1),
('Marcus Johnson', 4, 'Really solid pair of headphones overall. The audio quality exceeded my expectations with deep bass and clear highs. Noise cancellation feature is very effective in most environments, though I noticed it struggles slightly with sudden loud noises. The padding on the ear cups is comfortable enough for several hours of continuous use. Battery life lives up to the advertised claims which is refreshing. My only minor complaint is that they feel a bit bulky when folded for travel compared to my previous pair. The controls are intuitive and easy to use without looking. Connection range is impressive throughout my apartment. Would definitely recommend to friends looking for quality headphones.', 1),
('Jennifer Lee', 5, 'I purchased these headphones three months ago and they have completely transformed my listening experience. The active noise cancellation is phenomenal - I use them while working from home and they eliminate all background distractions perfectly. Sound quality is studio-grade with incredible detail and separation between instruments. The build feels luxurious with premium materials throughout. Battery performance has been consistently excellent, often exceeding the advertised duration. Comfort is top-notch even during marathon listening sessions. The companion app offers useful customization options for sound profiles. These headphones make every genre of music sound amazing. Absolutely no regrets with this purchase whatsoever.', 1),
('David Chen', 3, 'These headphones are decent but have some notable drawbacks in my experience. The sound quality is good with nice clarity, though I expected slightly better bass response for the price point. Noise cancellation works adequately but is not as effective as some competing models I have tried. The fit is comfortable initially but becomes somewhat fatiguing after a couple hours of wear. Battery life is reliable and meets expectations without issues. Build quality seems solid though the plastic components feel a bit cheaper than anticipated. Bluetooth connectivity occasionally drops when moving between rooms. They are good headphones but perhaps slightly overpriced for what you actually get in terms of performance and features.', 1),
('Amanda Rodriguez', 5, 'Simply the best headphones I have purchased in years of searching for the perfect pair. The noise cancellation technology is remarkably effective even in extremely noisy environments like airplanes and busy offices. Audio fidelity is exceptional with rich, warm tones and impressive soundstage. Comfort level is unmatched - the memory foam cushions and adjustable headband ensure perfect fit. Battery life consistently delivers more than advertised which is fantastic for long trips. The quick charge feature is incredibly convenient when I forget to charge overnight. Build quality inspires confidence with attention to detail throughout. Controls are perfectly placed and responsive. These headphones have become an essential part of my daily routine.', 1),
('Robert Taylor', 5, 'This fitness watch has completely revolutionized how I approach my health and exercise routines. The heart rate monitoring is remarkably accurate compared to chest strap monitors I have used previously. GPS tracking is precise and maps my running routes perfectly every single time. Sleep tracking provides fascinating insights that have helped me improve my rest quality significantly. The interface is intuitive and responsive with beautiful graphics. Battery life easily lasts five days with heavy use including GPS activities. Water resistance is genuine - I swim with it regularly without any issues. Smartphone notifications are convenient and keep me connected without constantly checking my phone. Worth every cent for serious fitness enthusiasts.', 2),
('Emily Watson', 4, 'Very impressed with this fitness watch after using it for two months consistently. The activity tracking is comprehensive and motivates me to move more throughout the day. Heart rate sensor seems accurate based on comparison with gym equipment readings. GPS lock is usually fast though occasionally takes longer in dense urban areas. Sleep tracking data is interesting and appears reasonably accurate. The watch face is bright and easily readable in direct sunlight. Battery performance is solid, typically getting four to five days per charge. The companion app is well-designed with useful analytics and trends. My only complaint is the band feels slightly uncomfortable during intense workouts. Overall excellent value for fitness tracking.', 2),
('James Brown', 5, 'Outstanding fitness watch that delivers on all its promises and then some. The build quality is exceptional with premium materials that feel durable and comfortable. Fitness tracking capabilities are incredibly comprehensive covering virtually every activity imaginable. Heart rate monitoring is spot-on accurate which is crucial for training zones. GPS performance is flawless with quick satellite acquisition and accurate tracking. The sleep analysis features have genuinely helped me understand and improve my sleep patterns. Battery life exceeds expectations consistently lasting nearly a week. Water resistance has been tested extensively with swimming and showering without problems. The smartwatch features are useful without being overwhelming. Best fitness watch available at this price point.', 2),
('Lisa Anderson', 4, 'Really happy with this fitness watch purchase overall despite a few minor issues. The tracking accuracy for steps and distance seems very reliable based on known routes. Heart rate monitoring appears consistent though I cannot verify absolute accuracy. GPS functionality works well once it locks on, which sometimes takes a minute or two. Sleep tracking is fascinating and has revealed some interesting patterns about my rest. The screen is vibrant and touch response is excellent. Battery life is good, usually four days with moderate use including one GPS workout. The app ecosystem could use some improvement with better third-party integrations. Comfortable to wear all day and night. Solid choice for fitness tracking.', 2),
('Michael Kim', 3, 'This fitness watch is okay but falls short of expectations in several areas unfortunately. Step counting seems somewhat inflated compared to other devices I own. Heart rate readings occasionally show strange spikes that do not match how I feel. GPS tracking drains the battery much faster than advertised which is disappointing. Sleep tracking is basic and does not provide much actionable insight. The interface can be laggy at times especially when navigating through menus quickly. Water resistance works fine for swimming as advertised. Notifications from phone work reliably which is nice. Build quality is acceptable though the screen scratches easier than expected. For the price, I expected more refined performance and features from this device.', 2),
('Jessica Martinez', 5, 'This water bottle is absolutely perfect for my active lifestyle and daily hydration needs. The insulation performance is truly impressive - ice water stays cold for the entire day even in summer heat. The stainless steel construction feels incredibly durable and premium. The leak-proof lid has never failed me even when tossed in my gym bag. The wide mouth opening makes it easy to clean thoroughly and add ice cubes. The powder coating provides excellent grip and has not chipped despite daily use for months. The size is ideal for staying hydrated without being too bulky to carry. No metallic taste whatsoever which is important to me. Easy to hand wash and maintain. Best water bottle investment ever.', 3),
('Daniel White', 4, 'Very satisfied with this water bottle for everyday use and outdoor activities. The temperature retention is excellent - coffee stayed hot for my entire morning commute and then some. Build quality seems solid with thick stainless steel walls. The capacity is perfect for long hikes without being excessively heavy when filled. The mouth opening is wide enough for ice but narrow enough to drink from comfortably. Easy to clean by hand though it does not fit in my car cup holder which is a minor inconvenience. The exterior finish has held up well with minimal wear after several months. No leaks or issues with the lid seal. Great value for the quality provided. Would purchase again.', 3),
('Rachel Green', 5, 'I cannot say enough good things about this fantastic water bottle that has exceeded all my expectations. The double-wall insulation is phenomenal keeping drinks at the perfect temperature for incredibly long periods. The stainless steel material is clearly high quality with a substantial feel. The leak-proof design actually works unlike many bottles I have tried before. The powder coat finish is beautiful and provides excellent grip even with wet hands. The wide mouth makes it easy to add fruit or ice and clean thoroughly. No unpleasant metallic taste or odor at all which is crucial. Perfect size for daily hydration goals. The durability is impressive withstanding daily use and occasional drops. Worth every penny.', 3),
('Christopher Hall', 4, 'Solid water bottle that performs well for my daily hydration and gym sessions. Insulation keeps water cold for most of the day which is impressive. The stainless steel construction feels robust and well-made. The lid screws on securely and has not leaked during transport. The exterior coating has held up reasonably well with minor wear starting to show. The capacity is good though I wish it was slightly larger for all-day use. Easy to clean with a bottle brush and does not retain odors. The weight when full is manageable for carrying around. Fits in most backpack side pockets which is convenient. Good quality bottle at a fair price point overall.', 3),
('Sophia Young', 3, 'This water bottle is decent but has some issues that prevent me from loving it completely. The insulation works adequately keeping drinks cold for several hours though not quite the full twenty-four claimed. The wide mouth opening is nice for filling but makes drinking while walking awkward. The powder coating started chipping around the bottom after just a few weeks of normal use. The lid seal works well enough but requires very tight screwing to prevent minor leaks. Cleaning is straightforward though the threading collects gunk over time. The size is reasonable but feels a bit heavy when filled completely. For the price, I expected slightly better quality and durability. It serves its basic purpose but nothing exceptional.', 3),
('Brandon Scott', 5, 'This gaming keyboard is an absolute game-changer that has dramatically improved my gaming performance and enjoyment. The mechanical switches feel incredible with perfect tactile feedback and satisfying clicks. The RGB lighting is stunning with endless customization options through the software. Key response is instantaneous with zero latency or ghosting during intense gaming sessions. The build quality is exceptional with a solid aluminum frame that does not flex. The dedicated media controls are incredibly convenient for adjusting volume without leaving the game. The keycaps feel premium with excellent texture and durability. The detachable cable is a thoughtful touch for easy transport. Every keystroke feels precise and consistent. Best keyboard investment for serious gamers.', 4),
('Ashley Turner', 4, 'Really enjoying this mechanical keyboard for both gaming and typing tasks. The Cherry MX switches provide excellent tactile response and are satisfying to use. RGB backlighting is vibrant with many customization options though the software could be more intuitive. The anti-ghosting works flawlessly during fast-paced gaming scenarios. Build quality is solid with minimal flex on the deck. The wrist rest would be a nice inclusion but is sold separately unfortunately. Key travel and actuation point feel perfect for my preferences. The noise level is reasonable for mechanical switches but may disturb others nearby. Media controls are handy and well-positioned. Great keyboard that significantly enhances the gaming experience overall.', 4),
('Kevin Harris', 5, 'Phenomenal gaming keyboard that delivers professional-grade performance at a reasonable price point. The mechanical switches are absolutely perfect with consistent actuation across all keys. The RGB lighting system is incredibly versatile with smooth effects and per-key customization. The aluminum construction feels premium and built to last years of heavy use. Key rollover and anti-ghosting technology work flawlessly even during the most frantic button mashing. The keycaps are high-quality PBT material that resists shine and wear. The braided cable feels durable and the cable routing options are thoughtful. Software is comprehensive allowing deep customization of macros and lighting. Typing experience is excellent for productivity work too. Cannot recommend this keyboard enough.', 4),
('Megan Clark', 4, 'Very pleased with this mechanical gaming keyboard after several weeks of daily use. The key switches feel great with nice tactile feedback that is satisfying for both gaming and typing. RGB lighting is impressive with vibrant colors and smooth transitions between effects. The frame is sturdy and does not move around during intense gaming moments. Anti-ghosting functionality works as advertised handling multiple simultaneous key presses. The dedicated media controls are useful and save time. The feet provide good angle adjustment options for comfortable typing position. Software could be more user-friendly but offers good functionality once you learn it. Slightly expensive but the quality justifies the price. Excellent choice for gamers.', 4),
('Tyler Lewis', 3, 'This keyboard is okay for gaming but has several drawbacks that are worth considering. The mechanical switches feel fine but are noticeably louder than I expected which can be annoying. RGB lighting is nice but the software to control it is clunky and sometimes does not save settings. Build quality is decent though it feels lighter and less premium than the price suggests. Some keys occasionally feel less responsive than others which concerns me. The layout is standard but I would prefer dedicated macro keys for gaming. The cable is not detachable which makes storage and transport less convenient. Wrist rest not included is disappointing at this price point. Functional keyboard but not exceptional value.', 4),
('Nicole Walker', 5, 'This portable power bank is absolutely essential for my daily life and travel needs. The capacity is enormous providing multiple full charges for my smartphone and tablet. The fast charging capability works incredibly well getting devices to full battery quickly. The LED display showing exact battery percentage is extremely useful and accurate. The build quality feels robust with a premium finish that resists scratches. Dual USB ports allow charging two devices simultaneously without reduced speed. The size and weight are very reasonable considering the massive capacity. Charges itself relatively quickly when plugged in overnight. Compatible with all my devices without any issues. Safety features provide peace of mind. Best power bank purchase ever made.', 5),
('Justin Adams', 4, 'Very satisfied with this power bank for keeping devices charged during long days and trips. The battery capacity is substantial providing three to four full smartphone charges easily. Fast charging works well though not quite as fast as some wall chargers. The LED display is clear and convenient showing remaining power accurately. Build quality is good with a solid feel and nice texture. Both USB ports work simultaneously which is very practical. Size is manageable for daily carry in a backpack though a bit bulky for pockets. Recharge time is reasonable taking several hours for full capacity. Great value for the power capacity provided. Reliable performance overall.', 5),
('Samantha Hill', 5, 'Extremely impressed with this high-capacity power bank that has become indispensable for my lifestyle. The battery capacity is fantastic easily handling multiple charges for all my devices. Fast charging technology is genuinely fast restoring my phone battery in record time. The digital display is brilliant showing precise battery percentage at a glance. The construction quality is excellent with premium materials and finish. Charging two devices at once works perfectly without compromising speed. The compact design considering the capacity makes it very portable. Multiple safety protections provide confidence against overcharging or overheating. Compatible with every device I own including tablets and wireless earbuds. Exceptional product that delivers on every promise made.', 5),
('Andrew Baker', 4, 'Happy with this power bank purchase for emergency charging and travel situations. The capacity is impressive providing several full charges before needing to recharge it. Fast charging feature works reasonably well though I have seen faster from other chargers. The percentage display is helpful for knowing exactly how much power remains. Build quality seems durable with a nice weight that feels substantial. Dual ports are convenient for charging multiple devices when needed. The size is acceptable though slightly larger than ideal for everyday pocket carry. Recharging the power bank takes a while due to the large capacity which is understandable. Good performance and reliability for the price point. Solid choice.', 5),
('Victoria Nelson', 3, 'This power bank is functional but falls short of expectations in some areas unfortunately. The capacity seems less than advertised based on the number of phone charges I actually get. Fast charging works but is not noticeably faster than standard charging speeds. The LED display is useful but the battery percentage seems to drop inconsistently. Build quality is acceptable though it feels somewhat plastic and cheap for the price. Charging two devices simultaneously significantly reduces charging speed which is disappointing. The weight and size make it less portable than I hoped for daily carry. Takes extremely long to fully recharge the power bank itself overnight is not enough. Adequate power bank but better options exist.', 5);